# Rules | Web Aplication Patinha Laranja Pet Shop

Create a web application, where, for this exercise, automated tests will not be used, only manual tests. After creating the application, develop based on the following rule:

1. Define the tests;
2. Specify which techniques will be used;
3. Which artifacts will be used;
4. Execute the tests;
5. Report the defects;
6. Describe your main takeaways.
